# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Seth (Feng) Li - sethfengli.com
# This repo holds ONLY the published Jekyll site. The build tooling lives one
# level up in ../tools/ and ../.preview/ (outside the repo, never published).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Personal documents: never commit ---------------------------------------
# Resume / CV and any Office binary documents stay local.
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.pages
*.key
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.csv

# Office / LibreOffice lock files ("~$Resume.docx") that appear while a
# document is open. They contain the document name, so never publish them.
~$*

# --- Jekyll build output ----------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Pages builds from source; _site/ is only produced by a local
# `jekyll serve` / `jekyll build` and must never be committed.
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
.sass-cache/

# --- Local tooling (the Node checks write here) -----------------------------
# The verifier writes .preview/ at the repo root normally; this line covers a
# future run from inside the site directory.
.preview/

# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Python experiments ----------------------------------------------------
# Not used by the site, but the sibling repos (chinesepoem, linqijing) are
# Python; keep the essentials so a dropped-in notebook never gets committed.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
